In the most recent versions of NetHack, vorpal jabberwocks are present
but compiled out of the game. This patch does two things: first, it
places them in the game, and second, it gives both of their claw
attacks a one-in-forty (2.5%) chance of beheading you - this being the
"vorpal" part of their name (and, since there's two claw attacks, that
means it's about a one-in-twenty (5%) chance of decapitation for the
entire turn).

